---
description: Terraform and GCP infrastructure delivery guardrails
globs: infra/**/*.tf
alwaysApply: false
---

# Terraform Standards

- Modularize by domain capability and environment.
- Pin provider versions and document upgrade strategy.
- Prefer reusable modules over copy-paste resources.

# GCP Standards

- Use least-privilege IAM and explicit service boundaries.
- Enable monitoring, alerting, and structured logs by default.
- Keep network topology explicit (VPC, subnet, ingress, egress).

# Delivery

- Run format, validate, and plan checks before merge.
- Keep state strategy and drift handling documented.
